Two character key check
The program reads one character and compares it with the letter O
If it differs the program enters an endless loop and never halts
If it matches a second character is read and compared with the letter K
Only the input OK reaches the halt label
Changing either character makes the run hang forever
The analysis stays finite because an endless branch never reads again

